 .../AcpiClockInitDxe/K3AcpiClockInitDxe.c     | 154 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../AcpiClockInitDxe/K3AcpiClockInitDxe.inf   |  48 ++++++
 2 files changed, 202 insertions(+)
